1. d4 d5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. Bf4 Bf5 4. f3 { Pawn storm against Bf5. } 4... e6 5. g4! { Keep in mind that whenever white has the opportunity to attack black's
kingside. Sieze it and capitalize towards it! } 5... Bg6 6. h4 h6 7. e3 c5 8. h5 Bh7 9. Nb5 { Common ideas are f3, g4, and h4-h5. You will then build up enough
concentrated attack on black's kingside. } *


