1. d4 Nf6 2. Nc3 d5 3. Bf4 Bf5 4. f3 e6 5. g4 Bg6 6. h4 h5 (6... h6 { Alternative. } 7. e3 c5 8. h5) 7. g5 { Kicking the knight. } { [%cal Rg5f6] } 7... Nfd7 8. e3 { Making the room for a bishop. } { [%cal Bf1d3] } 8... Bd6 9. Nh3! { Protects bishop on f4 and in future can make a pressure on Bg6. } { [%cal Gh3f4,Yf4g6] } 9... Nc6 10. Nb5 { [%cal Rb5d6] } 10... Bxf4 { Might be slightly inaccurate to take and give white tempo on bishop, but leaves Nb5 a bit a dubious. } { [%csl Yb5][%cal Rh3f4,Yf4g6] } 11. Nxf4 Bf5 12. Bd3 Ne7 { [%cal Ge7f5] } 13. Qd2 { Simply develops the queen. With long caste in plan. } { [%cal Be1c1] } 13... a6 { Kicking the knight and grabbing space queen side. } { [%cal Ra6b5,Bc7c5] } 14. Nc3 c5 15. O-O-O cxd4 16. exd4 { Opens c file towards white king. } { [%cal Yc8c3,Ba8c8,Bd8c8] } 16... Bxd3 17. Nxd3 Qb6 18. Ne2 g6 19. Kb1 Nf5 20. c3 Qd6 21. f4 b5 22. Ng1 { Great outpost for the knight on e5. } { [%csl Be5][%cal Bg1f3,Bf3e5] } 22... a5 23. Nf3 Nb6 24. Nfe5 Nc4 25. Qf2 O-O 26. Rc1 Rfc8 27. Rhe1 b4 28. Nc5 bxc3 29. bxc3 Rab8+ 30. Ka1 Na3 31. Re2 Rb5 32. Rb2 Rcb8 33. Rxb5 Rxb5 34. Ned7 Qc7 35. Qe2 Qxf4 36. Nd3 Qe3 37. Qd1 Nc4 38. Rb1 Rxb1+ 39. Qxb1 Kg7 40. N7c5 Qd2 41. Qb3 Nxh4 42. a4 Nf3 43. Nxe6+ Kh7 44. Nef4 Nxg5 45. Kb1 Qxd3+ 46. Nxd3 Nd2+ 47. Kc2 Nxb3 48. Kxb3 Ne4 49. Nf4 h4 50. c4 Nd2+ 51. Kc3 Nxc4 52. Nxd5 h3 53. Nf6+ Kg7 54. Ng4 Nb6 55. Kd3 f5 56. Nh2 Kf6 57. Ke3 g5 58. Kf3 Nxa4 59. Kg3 g4 60. Kf4 Nc3 61. Kg3 a4 { 0-1, Baadur Aleksandrovich Jobava 2713 - Sergei Zhigalko 2678, World
Blitz Championship, Dubai UAE (17.30), 2014.06.20 } *


